# INC0000039 — Trouble getting to Oregon mail server
- Issue: Mail server (MailServerUS) unreachable; caller reported outage
- Problem found: Ticket was set to Priority "5 - Planning" despite being an active outage that had already breached its SLA target (Network group resolution OLA showed 106,673% of allotted business time elapsed)
## Actions taken:
- Corrected Urgency/Impact to reflect actual severity of a mail server outage
- Set State to "In Progress" and assigned to self
- Added troubleshooting notes documenting investigation steps
- Resolved with resolution code and notes summarizing the fix
- Why it matters: Shows ability to spot misprioritized tickets and correct SLA-risk situations — a common real-world triage skill
